{
    //Dispositions
    "Blanche.NPC.Name": "Blanche",

    //Gift taste 
    "gift.love": "Wow, you are really giving this to me? Thanks for making me happy!$1",
    "gift.like": "A gift? Thanks!",
    "gift.dislike": "Well, that's unusual.$2",
    "gift.hate": "I don't like this.$2",
    "gift.neutral": "Thank you.",
	
	//Goldenapple Dialogue
	"Goldenapple.Wizard":"This is a fruit with a very interesting energy.",
	"Goldenapple.Abigail":"Oh, golden apples! It's too pretty to eat.$1",
	"Goldenapple.Elliott":"Thanks, this looks a lot like the golden apple from Greek mythology.$h#$b#I'm inspired by this sweet scent...$h",
	"Goldenapple.Haley":"*gasp* \"To the most beautiful\"... It's a very touching gift. I love it.$h",
	"Goldenapple.Penny":"Oh... I've never seen a golden apple before. This looks very precious, and are you giving it to me?#$b#Thank you. I'll cherish it.$h",

	//items and desert dialogue
	"weapon.RilkePoetryCollection": "Rilke Poetry Collection",
	"Blanche.Portrait": "Blanche's Portrait",
	"weapon.RilkePoetryCollection.description": "Blanche's favorite book of Rilke poems. If you look closely, you can see that it's a hardcover book. It looks like it would hurt quite a bit to be hit with this.",
	"Desert.Blanche.Seller":"Feel free to browse my store. I happened to have two copies of the same book of poetry, and I wanted to sell one.",
	"DesertFestival.Blanche":"It's sunny here, which is great.$1#$b#I'm photosynthesizing like a cactus.$1",
	"DesertFestival.Blanche.marriage":"Skull Cave... It looks too dangerous. You should be careful if you go there, @.$0#$b#One more thing, watch out for for puddles. Venomous scorpion carp are said to live there.$6",
	"Blanche.Goldenapple.Fruit":"Golden Apple",
	"Blanche.Goldenapple.FruitDescription":"'A golden apple that reads 'To the most beautiful'.",
	"Blanche.Goldenapple.Sapling":"Golden Apple Tree Seedlings",
	"Blanche.Goldenapple.SaplingDescription": "Seedlings presented by Blanche. The fruit is harvested in summer and takes 28 days to grow.",
	

    //ExtraDialogue
    "playerkilled.notspouse": "Oh, are you awake, @?9#$b#You were knocked out, so I was taking care of you.$0#$b#Be careful, @.$2",
    "playerkilled.spouse": "@..! @!!$6#$b#Oh, my! Are you okay?$6#$b#I was so surprised. I'm glad you didn't get hurt so badly..$8#$b#Please be careful.$8",
	"Summit.Event": "Before I met you, my world was very small.$3#$b#Compared to the freedom I enjoyed, I always felt like something was lacking, and my heart felt stuffy.\"/pause 1000/speak Blanche \"But when I'm with you, I'm not afraid of anything, @. You know what I mean?$1#$b#Infinite time, magical powers, new adventures... Whatever it is, it's just insignificant compared to you.\"/pause 1000/speak Blanche \"Now the only wish I have left is to grow old at the same rate as you.$3#$b#I love you.$1",
	
	//Modify Wedding Dialogue
	"ModifyWedding.1": "When @ first arrived in Pelican Town, no one knew if he'd fit in with our community...#$b#But from this day forward, @ is going to be as much a part of this town as any of us!$h#$b#It is my great honor on this day {0} of {1}, to unite @ and Blanche in the bonds of marriage.",
	"ModifyWedding.2": "When @ first arrived in Pelican Town, no one knew if she'd fit in with our community...#$b#But from this day forward, @ is going to be as much a part of this town as any of us!$h#$b#It is my great honor on this day {0} of {1}, to unite @ and Blanche in the bonds of marriage.",
	"ModifyWedding.3": "@... Blanche... #$b# As the mayor of Pelican Town, and regional bearer of the matrimonial seal, I now pronounce you husband and wife!$h",
	"ModifyWedding.4": "@... Blanche... #$b# As the mayor of Pelican Town, and regional bearer of the matrimonial seal, I now pronounce you wife and..., well, wife!$h",
	
    // Engagement Dialogue
    "engagement.0": "I'd like to get married right now, but we need time to get ready, right?$4#$b#Actually, I'm so happy now that I'm dazed. See you later, my love!",
    "engagement.1": "@, You came to see me? The preparations for the wedding are going well.$4#$b#Of course, I was busy going to the city to rent a wedding dress.$2#$e#You're as busy I am. aren't you?$0",
   
    //Rainy Dialogue
	"rainy.dialogue": "Do you know that the people in this town don't use umbrellas even when it rain?$9#$b#When I asked Marnie why, she said if I used an umbrella here, it would be a lightning rod..$2#$e#So I don't use an umbrella anymore. I'd rather get rained on and catch a cold.$9",
	
	//Festivals
	"spring13.general":"@, Are you in the tournament today?$0#$b#I checked in advance, and the eggs were on Lewis's truck and near the cemetery.$0#$b#I think Lewis really hid them all over the place.$2",
	"spring24.general":"The scent of flowers in the air is very fragrant, isn't it?$1#$b#All the flowers used for the festival were grown by the villagers.$0#$b#Of course I grew flowers, too.$0",
	"summer11.general":"Last year, Sam put red mushrooms in the soup.$9#$b#Oh, You want to know what I put in soup last year? I put some grain.$0#$b#Grain is the basis of food.$0",
	"summer28.general":"'Dance of the Moonlight Jellies' is my favorite festival.$0#$b#I hate the cold at night, but it's okay.$2#$e#I wanted to attend today.$1",
	"fall16.general": "Hi, @. Are you here to see a fortune teller?$0#$b#Hmm... I'm thinking about whether to look at the fortune teller or not.$2#$e#I'm curious about the future, but I don't want to hear bad things and worry ahead of time.$1",
	"fall27.general": "Oh, Spirit's Eve.. I came to the festival for now, but I am anxious.$3#$b#...Do you feel that, @? Various souls and monsters were immersed in this atmosphere and gained strength.$9#$e#But it's nice to see people enjoying festivals.$0",
	"winter8.general":"These ice sculptures are very nice and beautiful.$0",
	"winter25.general": "The Feast of the Winter Star is a little cold, but the atmosphere is good.$1#$e#Everyone seems happy.$1",
	"spring13.spouse":"I painted some eggs this time and hid them all over the place.$1#$b#Will you please find the eggs I painted?$1",
	"spring24.spouse":"You shine today, my love..$4#$b#Everyone's staring at you.$4",
	"summer11.spouse":"Oh, @. What are you going to put in the soup? Whatever the crops you grow, they'll be delicious.$1#$b#I'll be looking forward to it!$1",
	"summer28.spouse":"It's a beautiful sight. isn't it, my love?1#$b#Where do you want to stand during the highlight? .....Beside Lewis? Oh...$6#$b#I can't see well in the dark. So just wait a little while for me to come.$2",
	"fall16.spouse": "Whoo... Finally! @, remember what I told you yesterday?$5#$b#You must beat Pierre!$1",
	"fall27.spouse": "Oh, Darling, come here. Stay with me.$2#$b#I was nervous until you came, but now I'm fine.$1",
	"winter8.spouse":"Are you participating in the fishing contest today?$0#$b#I'm sure you'll win.$1",
	"winter25.spouse": "Merry Christmas, @.$1#$b#*Kiss*Have a great festival!$4",
	
	//Festivals y2
	"spring13.general.2":"@, Are you in the tournament today?$0#$b#Maybe he hid the egg behind a big tree or a house.$0#$b#I think Lewis really hid them all over the place.$2",
	"spring24.general.2":"Everyone looks so excited, and the spring breeze is so nice.$1#$b#I would probably wear a pink dress if I were to dance.$0",
	"summer11.general.2":"Last year I added some rice to the soup, but this year I added pumpkin.$0#$b#It's sweeter than grains, so I thought it would be a great way to flavor soups, like a natural sweetener.$1",
	"summer28.general.2":"It's still chilly at this time of year, and if it wasn't for the late summer, I wouldn't have come out.$2#$e#Still, the sea at night is beautiful.$1",
	"fall16.general.2": "Hi, @. Are you here to see a fortune teller?$0#$b#I had my fortune told this year, and I'm glad to say that it came out pretty good.$1#$e#Oh, you want specifics?$6#$b#Oh, that's a secret..$1",
	"fall27.general.2": "You know, @. The mine cart next to the store... Do you see it?$2#$b#Monsters aren't going to come down through there, are they...?$2#$e#Just in case, I think I'd better be around here.$9",
	"winter8.general.2":"These are great sculptures that you worked hard to create, but they will melt away as the weather warms up...$2#$b#But it's all part of the art, right?$0#$e#It's a good thing we have so many ways to record things these days, like taking pictures.$1",
	"winter25.general.2": "There are so many different cuisines, aren't there? I'm having a hard time choosing...$1#$e#$y 'Which one would you try if you were you?_Pie with minced mushroom filling_Oh, it's like a warm, savory pie, and you're right, I need to try this.$1_A slice of chocolate cake with a cherry on top._All right, I'll definitely try it for dessert later.$1_A lump of coal_...Umm, Is that a farmer's joke?$2'",
	
	"spring24.spouse.2":"It's been a while since I last danced... Maybe I should've practiced beforehand.$2#$e#Even if we make a mistake... we'll still have the most fun at the dance today!$1",
	"summer11.spouse.2":"@, guess what I put in the soup today?#$b#To be honest, I had set up a crab pot down at the beach for the Luau.$1#$b#When I checked it this morning, I caught a bunch of different clams, so I tossed them right into the soup.$1#$e#So, what did you add to the soup, honey?$1",
	"summer28.spouse.2":"When I saw the moonlight jellies last year, they looked just like stars in the night sky.$0#$b#Doesn't it feel like they might grant a wish?#$e#My wish is to keep staying happy with you forever.$1",
	"fall16.spouse.2": "@, once you're done with the grange display, let's go grab some festival food together!$1#$b#Gus is making BBQ sandwiches and mushroom-leek sandwiches with chickpea hummus.$1",
	"fall27.spouse.2": "Darling, even if you see the witch's house in the maze, don't go inside.$9#$b#If something goes wrong, you might end up in another dimension...$2",
	"winter8.spouse.2":"*Phew* @, you're entering the fishing contest today, right?#$b#It's a bit cold out, but I'm staying here so I can cheer you on.$1",
	"winter25.spouse.2": "@, I hope Santa brings you whatever you wished for today!$1#$b#And I hope our family welcomes the new year happy and sound!$1",
	
	//Custom call
	"Phone.Ring.Blanche1": "Hello, @! It's spring, so you're probably in the middle of some serious farming, right?$0#$b#In the spring, I pick the soil in the village flower beds that have been resting all winter and tend to the newly sprouting plants.#$b#I take care of it every year with the villagers, so you should come and see it when you have time. bye! *click*$1",
	"Phone.Ring.Blanche2": "Hi, @! It's thundering outside. You know that, right?$2#$b#I think it would be better to wear a raincoat than an umbrella on a day like this. Because the umbrella can become a lightning rod.$2#$b#Well, anyway, I hope your farm didn't suffer any major damage, @. See you later. *click*$0",
	"Phone.Ring.Blanche3": "Hi, @! It's getting a little chilly, how are you doing?$0#$b#The fall leaves are turning beautifully these days, and I love them as much as I love flowers.$1#$b#Hmmm, maybe I could collect fallen leaves and make something out of them, right?$1#$b#Haha, I'm going to hang up now. bye! *click*$1",
	"Phone.Ring.Blanche4": "Hello, @! Did you know it's snowing right now? It's cold, but it's pretty.$1#$b#I know it's hard to farm in the winter, but it's the end of the year, and I hope you're getting some rest.$0#$b#Then I'll hang up now, bye! *click*$1",
    
	//Movie reactions
	"movies.tree.1": "'The Brave Little Sapling,' I like the title.$7",
	"movies.tree.2": "Originally, adventure is a way to be a true tree.$7",
	"movies.tree.3": "That was the best! I like it more because it's a happy ending.$1#$b#And it's interesting that it's a tree-star movie.$1",
	"movies.horror.1": "Well, I'm horrified even after I've only seen the poster.$9",
	"movies.horror.2": "Blanche looks a little pale.",
	"movies.horror.3": "If I get jumpscare scene, I might run out of here...$5",
	"movies.horror.4": "Oh, please recommend a bright movie next time.$2",
	"movies.love.1": "It looks fun just by looking at the poster!$1",
	"movies.love.2": "Blanche’s eyes shine!",
	"movies.love.3": "It was a good movie, thank you for inviting me.$1",
	"movies.like.1": "Honestly, I read a lot more books than movies, so it's a little unfamiliar.$0#$b#But I think it'll be fun.$0",
	"movies.like.2": "It was a fun time.$1",
	"movies.dislike.1": "Well, I don't think it's my taste.$2",
	"movies.dislike.2": "....$3",
	"movies.dislike.3": "I'm sorry, honestly, it wasn't funny.$2",


	//Event Dialogues
	
	//2 heart Event
    "2hearts.1": "What should I do...?$2",
    "2hearts.2": "Oh, @...? Hi. You came at the perfect time.$0",
    "2hearts.3": "Can you come over here and look at this plant for a minute?$0#$b#This plant has been withering lately.$9#$b#You're a farmer, so I think you know about plants than me, Please.$2",
    "2hearts.4": "Well, What do you think is lacking?",
    "2hearts.5": "(This plant is perfect! There's nothing more we can do for this.)",
    "2hearts.6": "(Spray fertilizer on this plant.)",
    "2hearts.7": "(Move the plant outdoors to let the sun shine.)",
    "2hearts.8": "...When you think about it, nature grows outdoor plants on its own. So I don't know how to take care of plants indoors..$9#$b#All living things seem to be healthy and happy when they live with nature.$0",
    "2hearts.9": "Oh, I've been too sentimental, Right?$2#$b#Anyway, I'll try to get this plant back in good health. Thanks for your help today.$0",
    "2hearts.10": "Thanks for your help, @.$1",

	//4 heart Event-1
    "4hearts.1": "Good morning, @.$0#$b#It's first time visiting your farm, isn't it?$0#$b#Phew, I think this place is too far from the library.$2",
    "4hearts.2": "The reason I visited here is because I recently heard that you were invited to Caroline's Sunroom.$0#$b#I'm one of the people invited there, too. So, I asked Caroline if she could have tea time with you there, and she gladly agreed.$1",
    "4hearts.3": "Let's meet in the sunroom in the afternoon, if you don't mind.$1",
	
	// 4 heart Event-2
    "4hearts.4": "Oh, @! welcome.$1#$b#You wonder how I ended up using this place, right?$0",
    "4hearts.5": "Actually, I take care of the plants here.$0#$b#Caroline and I became close after taking care of the community flower beds, which led us to stop by here from time to drink tea and take care of plants.$1",
    "4hearts.6": "Then, would you like to have a cup of tea with me?$0",
    "4hearts.7": "It's very fragrant, isn't it? It's made of tea leaves grown here.$1#$b#These days, I'm taking care of the plants in the library and studying about them. $0#$b#Thanks to that attempt, I think it's easier to take care of the plants here. Of course, it's quiet here, so it's good to meditate.$3",
    "4hearts.8": "Give it a listen. Don't you feel like you can hear the breath of mysterious beings?$3",
    "4hearts.9": "Oh, Don't be so nervous!$0#$b#I'm not gonna play strange songs or show strange pictures. We've already been through this with Caroline.$1",
    "4hearts.10": "I just want to enjoy this time of talking to you and drinking tea.$1",
    "4hearts.11": "You know, it feels like...",
    "4hearts.12": "(we're on a date.)",
    "4hearts.13": "(we're playing house.)",
    "4hearts.14": "(we're being silly.)",
    "4hearts.15": "Oh, yeah. Actually, there's a cake that I baked for tea time with you.$1#$b#But isn't daytime the busiest time for farmers? So I didn't think we could eat together.$2",
	"4hearts.16": "So I packed it. Here you go.[Custom_Blanche_Cake]$0",
	"4hearts.17": "Let me know if it was delicious later!$1",
	"4hearts.18": "Why don't we have tea time together often? I loved it.$0",
	
	// 4 heart Event-items
	"Blanche.Cake.Item": "Black Forest Cake",
	"Blanche.Cake.Description": "Also known as 'Forêt-Noire'cake, this cake features an impressive combination of rich chocolate flavor and the sweet-and-tart taste of cherries.",
	"Mail.ForetNoireCake.Body": "@,^Here is the recipe for the Black Forest cake I gave you in the sunroom.^You should try making it sometime!^^-Blanche",
    "Mail.ForetNoireCake.Title": "Blanche's Black Forest Cake Recipe",

    //5 heart Event
    "5hearts.1": "Is that true!",
    "5hearts.2": "Really?",
    "5hearts.3": "Calm down",
    "5hearts.4": "I'm not lying. I saw it with my own eyes!$3",
    "5hearts.5": "Oh, my.$2",
    "5hearts.6": "Oh, dear... I'm glad you're here.$0#$b#Would you come and stop these old men from arguing?$0",
    "5hearts.7": "You came at the perfect time, young farmer!$0#$b#Come here and take a look at this.$0",
    "5hearts.8": "What George showed you is an old black-and-white photo.#There are three people who look like family members with a smile.",
    "5hearts.9": "Don't look at the people in front, look at the passers-by behind!$0",
    "5hearts.10": "Behind the family is a woman wearing a hat and carrying a suitcase.#She has pale braided hair and dark skin.",
    "5hearts.11": "Doesn't this passerby look like anyone?$0",
    "5hearts.12": "You didn't notice right away? ... Hmmph.#$b#This is a picture I took with my daughter and wife when I was young. So it's decades old!$0",
    "5hearts.13": "But the librarian working in the museum was definitely taken in the background! Don't you think it's weird?$0",
    "5hearts.14": "She's not human!$2",
    "5hearts.15": "Oh...$2",
	"5hearts.16": "Calm down, everybody. In common sense, how can a person who was young at this time be so young so far?$2#$b#I'm sure it's someone who looks like her, or a relative.$0",
	"5hearts.17": "Now, it's time to go home. We're sorry to bother you all when you're busy.$0",
	"5hearts.18": "I'm not wrong.",
	"5hearts.19": "Oh, that stubborn..$0",
	"5hearts.20": "Let's go together",
	"5hearts.21": "By the way, @... I heard you're close to Miss Blanche these days.0#$b#If you have a chance later, I'd like you to ask her.$0#$b#I don't think she's a different being...  But it's because as mayor, if she's a resident who originally had a connection to the village, I need to know.$2",

    //6 heart Event
    "6hearts.1": ".....So I'm having a hard time these days.$9",
    "6hearts.2": "Oh, that's really....$0#$b#...interesting just to hear!$3",
    "6hearts.3": "Hey, I'm very serious right now.$2",
    "6hearts.4": "Hmm, yeah. The story reminded me of the advice you need the most.$0",
    "6hearts.5": "What's that?$7",
    "6hearts.6": "First, you take the farmer to the woods for camping.$0#$b#If I have a chance after that, I'll scare you two.$3#$b#Then you can pretend to run away to the farmer's tent and spend a long night together. That's a good idea, right?$1",
    "6hearts.7": "What a ridiculous idea!",
    "6hearts.8": "You don't have to be so surprised. Love originally sprouts in a cris...$2",
    "6hearts.9": "...Wait. I can feel someone's presence.$0",
    "6hearts.10": "@? What brings you here in the middle of the night?$6#$b#...Oh, yeah. This place was right under your farm. I'm sorry if it was too loud.$2",
    "6hearts.11": "...I was just chatting to a friend.$0#$b#We are meeting at night because there are people during the day.$0",
    "6hearts.12": "Howdy!$2",
    "6hearts.13": "@, Can you listen to animals? Somehow, I could feel the strength of Mana who is weak but stable from you.$6",
    "6hearts.14": "(What should I ask her?)",
    "6hearts.15": "Did you drink the Wizard's potion like me?",
    "6hearts.16": "Are you a wizard?",
    "6hearts.17": "How do you understand animal language?",
    "6hearts.18": "So, the boring question and answer is over, right? I want to ask a farmer something.$0",
    "6hearts.19": "....No, you don't have to ask.$9",
    "6hearts.20": "This is an important question!",
    "6hearts.21": "Listen, there's a bear I know.$0#$b#The bear's a little different from other bears.. So, she's hesitating to confess to someone she likes.$0#$b#So, what advice I gave her is...$3",
	"6hearts.22": "The story is going weird... I'll tell you from now on.$6",
    "6hearts.23": "Do as you please.$0",
	"6hearts.24": "...Umm, Just let it in one ear and out the other. So even though she's scared to be rejected, she's still thinking about how to express her feelings to the other bear. It's a very preposterous problem, isn't it?$2",
	"6hearts.25": "Hey, How can you disparage other friend's worries like that?$0",
	"6hearts.26": "..I think I'm just gonna go home.",
	"6hearts.27": "No, you don't have to. I was about to go back now. See you next time.$2",
	"6hearts.28": "See ya",
	"6hearts.29": "Well, he's sociable, but he's so energetic that it's hard to keep up sometimes.$2",
	"6hearts.30": "You don't have to pay much attention to what he said earlier. Actually, it was a story of a friend I'm not very close to.$0",
	"6hearts.31": "(What shall I say?)",
	"6hearts.32": "Please tell the bear to cheer up.",
	"6hearts.33": "Please tell the bear that there are many other bears in the world.",
	"6hearts.34": "Please tell the bear that I'll be waiting.",
	"6hearts.35": "...By the way, I think the bear is stubborn and will end up acting in his own way.$1",
	"6hearts.36": "Thank you for listening to my story. So, you're going to bed now, aren't you?$0#$b#See you later, @.$1",
	
	//8 heart Event
    "8hearts.1": "@! I didn't expect to see you here.$1#$b#I was making a pressed flower bookmark for the library event.$0#$b#Because the number of library users is decreasing these days...$2#$b#I'm thinking of holding an event to give bookmarks to the person who borrowed the most books in a month.$0",
    "8hearts.2": "But the weather was too nice today to work only indoors.$0#$b#So I borrowed a mat from Penny and am working here.$1",
    "8hearts.3": "(What shall I say to her?)",
    "8hearts.4": "Is there anything I can help you with?",
    "8hearts.5": "Can I make something next to you?",
    "8hearts.6": "Can't you just hang out with me?",
    "8hearts.7": "Phew, it's done!$1",
    "8hearts.8": "Look, it looks prettier than I thought.$1",
    "8hearts.9": "A poem is written on the pressed flower bookmark.",
    "8hearts.10": "...",
    "8hearts.11": "The bookmark you made is really pretty.",
    "8hearts.12": "I like the poem you wrote on the bookmark.",
    "8hearts.13": "If I had made it, I would have made it better.",
    "8hearts.14": "So, I thought you were making something. What did you make, @?$0",
    "8hearts.15": "Oh, you made a flower crown. Are you giving it to me?$10#$b#How pretty!$11",
	"8hearts.16": "....Thank you, @. I'll treasure it.$11",
	"8hearts.17": "I really like the flower crown you made for me.$0#$b#So I'm going to keep the flowers in the flower crown from withering.$0#$b#Oh, you wonder how that's possible?$6#$b#That's a secret.$1",

    //10 heart Event
    "10hearts.1": "I can't hear the fairies whispering in the wind anymore...$3",
    "10hearts.2": "Hello, @. Somehow I thought I would meet you.$0#$b#Strangely, you always came to me first when I miss you.$1",
    "10hearts.3": "If you don't mind, could you listen to my story?",
    "10hearts.4": "Of course.",
    "10hearts.5": "If it's a heavy story, I think I need to be prepared.",
    "10hearts.6": "Remember when I asked you to look at the condition of the plants in the library?$9#$b#Actually, I knew why the plant was sick.$9",
    "10hearts.7": "It had told me in a very feeble voice that it wanted to feel the sun outside.$9#$b#And it wanted to drink rainwater, not tap water.$3",
    "10hearts.8": "That's why when we were having a conversation like that, you came.$0#$b#I was so embarrassed at the time that I pretended to ask you for advice and hid it.$2#$b#Because it's obvious that anyone who talks to plants would look weird.$2",
    "10hearts.9": "Have you ever heard rumors circulating in the village? There's a rumor... that I'm not a human being.$3",
    "10hearts.10": "Haha, I already know that you defended me then by silence. Thank you.$1#$b#That's why I was more hesitant to reveal my secret. I've always wanted to be normal in front of you.$3",
    "10hearts.11": "@, As you have already noticed, the rumor is true. I'm not an ordinary person.$9#$b#I'm an old tree that's more than a thousand years old. To be exact, I was a soul in a tree.$3",
    "10hearts.12": "Oh, but it's really no big deal, except I've lived a long time. Really.$6",
    "10hearts.13": "Anyway, I had stood in one place and watched countless seasons pass, life being born and dying. That's where the library is now.$9",
    "10hearts.14": "Surprised? You can't imagine how big a tree I was. I used to be much bigger than this tree!$1",
    "10hearts.15": "However, after decades and hundreds of years, people began to build their towns here.$3#$b#And soon they tried to build a library in their village.$3#$b#So they cut down my tree and set up a library there with the my wood.$9",
    "10hearts.16": "It's okay. I just changed a little as the tree disappeared.$0#$b#Right after that, I fell asleep for a while and when I woke up, I was a human being.$0",
    "10hearts.17": "Like this!",
    "10hearts.18": "Thanks to it, I was able to leave this town for the first time and travel the world. I've always stayed in one place, so I've wanted to see a variety of landscapes.$0",
    "10hearts.19": "However, the first time I saw the outside world was lively, varied, and wide, but on the contrary, it was noisy, scary, and always unstable.$3#$b#I tried to live in the city and learn how to live among people, but as time went by, I missed here.$3#$b#So eventually I came back. Although my tree is gone, I tried to take care of the forest using the power that is still left.$9",
    "10hearts.20": "But now... I can't hear nature whispering. Since the last time I took care of the plant with you, I couldn't hear anymore.$3",
    "10hearts.21": "The sound of the sun rising, the sound of butterflies flapping their wings, and the breath of fairies hiding between the grass forests... $9",
    "10hearts.22": "So I was a little depressed. I guess I broke up with my old self at some point.$0",
    "10hearts.23": "Don't be depressed. I'm with you.",
    "10hearts.24": "Do you know what caused it?",
	"10hearts.25": "Actually, I can be sure now.$4#$b#I love you, @.... This fact allowed me to be a complete person from an imperfect being.$4",
	"10hearts.26": "To be a real person, my original ability gradually disappeared, but I don't regret it.$0#$b#Because I want to be a complete human being and stay by your side.$1",
	"10hearts.27": "So now I'm really happy.$1",
	"10hearts.28": "I didn't expect to tell you this...$0",
	"10hearts.29": "@... Since I wasn't a person from the beginning, You might feel unfamiliar to me sometimes.$3#$b#But now I'm trying hard because I want to be with you.$0",
	"10hearts.30": "Could you stay with me forever?$1",
	"10hearts.31": "Oh, @.... What brings you here?$4#$b#...You still have a question. Don't hesitate to let me know.$6#$b#...Oh, You're wondering what I've been doing in the city? I finally settled down there, studied, made a new identity, got a job and made money.$1#$b#Those things were essential to live among people.$2#$b#It was a little hard, but it was meaningful that the process allowed you and I to meet.$1",


    //14 heart Event -1
    "14hearts.1": "@, Welcome. I actually had something to say when you came.$1",
    "14hearts.2": "There's a small greenhouse in my outdoor space, you know?$0#$b#I'll wait there.#$b#Before 3 p.m., find me when you have time!$1",
	//14 heart Event -2
	"14hearts.3": "Humm~ umm, hmm...$0",
	"14hearts.4": "Blanche is humming quietly.",
	"14hearts.5": "....She looks happy, but she doesn't know you've arrived yet.",
	"14hearts.6": "Oh, You're here, @. Welcome to my little greenhouse!$1",
	"14hearts.7": "How did you build such a large greenhouse in that small space?",
	"14hearts.8": "This place looks like Caroline's sunroom.",
	"14hearts.9": "This place is small but it looks beautiful.",
	"14hearts.10": "I always welcome you to my space, so please feel free to stop by.",
	"14hearts.11": "Instead, there are probably small bugs, frogs, and snails here.$6#$b#Or Junimo can visit.$0",
	"14hearts.12": "Do you know Greek and Roman mythology, @?$0#$b#I find it interesting to read such an old myth.$3#$b#You know, it's usually rare to be older than me.$2",
	"14hearts.13": "After a long time, the myth was remembered by people.0#$b#It's wonderful to be remembered for not being forgotten over time.$0#$b#That's why I like books. Books are the biggest tool for remembering the past.$1",
	"14hearts.14": "In fact, as I told you before, I'm pretty much out of mana now.$3",
	"14hearts.15": "So I thought about it. I wanted to use it to give you a meaningful gift.$3",
	"14hearts.16": "I wanted to make something that will last as long as possible in your memory.$0#$b#I wanted to make something that would suit your job and remind you of me.$0",
	"14hearts.17": "Haha, Guess what I made.$1",
	"14hearts.18": "Tree",
	"14hearts.19": "Flower",
	"14hearts.20": "Book",
	"14hearts.21": "The answer is tree. @.$1",
	"14hearts.22": "Do you remember the day I revealed myself?0#$b#From then on until now, you have believed me, without any doubt.$3",
	"14hearts.23": "For the rest of my life, can I meet someone who can trust, accept and love me like you?$0#$b#In my opinion, you're the only one.$4",
	"14hearts.24": "Here's the seedling I made.[Custom_BlancheGoldenapple_Sapling]$0#$b#If you grow this seedling, a golden apple will open.$1",
	"14hearts.25": "This seedling is just like my alter ego. I made it thinking of myself from the past.$3#$b#....And this seedling will be a great help to you.$1",
	"14hearts.26": "In the myth, Paris gives an apple to the most beautiful goddess. I also give this seedling to you, who are beautiful.$3#$b#Through this tree, please remember me.$4#$b#Thank you for marrying me, @. I love you.$4",
	"14hearts.27": "What's going on, @?$0#$b#Oh, is it disturbing that the story of golden apples and Paris is a tragedy?$6#$b#Paris apparently became unhappy by abandoning his ex-wife.$2#$e#That's not the case for us. Don't worry.$1",
   
	
	//Villager's Dialogues
	
	"EvelynDialogues.1": "Blanche sometimes stops by my house and arranges the bookshelf.#$b#And she takes the book I requested from the library and brings it to my house. She's a good girl.$h",
	"EvelynDialogues.2": "Welcome, I just happened to bake some cookies. Do you want to try them? [223]$h#$e#The day before yesterday, I baked cookies with Blanche. Let's bake together next time.",
	"EvelynDialogues.3": "How are you doing with Blanche?#$b#She is a good girl, but I'm worried because she doesn't seem to have many friends of her age.#$e#Please be Blanche's friend.$h",
	"EvelynDialogues.4": "Will you say hello to Blanche? If you have time, tell her to come and eat some cookies.#$e#I'm glad she married you.h",
	"EvelynDialogues.5": "I'm glad you married Blanche. She was like a granddaughter to me.#$e#I wish you two happiness.",
	"EvelynDialogues.6": "I think Blanche will like your farm.$h#$e#She loves plants, so I'm sure she'll like the plants on that place.",
	"CarolineDialogues.1": "You know Blanche who works as a librarian in our town library? We got close while we were growing the community flower bed together. I think the girl is a good person.#$b#But Blanche doesn't seem to get along with her age. Maybe it's because she's from the city.",
	"CarolineDialogues.2": "I'm glad you and Blanche got married, but I'm a little lonely because I don't have anyone to enjoy tea time with.#$e#Oh, but it's okay because she looks happy. That's what matters.$h",
	"CarolineDialogues.3": "How's your marriage to Blanche?#$b#There's a greenhouse on your farm, so she likes it, right?",
	"CarolineDialogues.4": "Oh, are you going to stop by the library today? Then give my regards to Blanche.#$e#If she has time, please tell her to come to my Sunroom.",
	"CarolineDialogues.5": "I think Abigail and Blanche are about the same age. I hope they get along with each other.#$e#In a way, their tendencies are quite the opposite. So they can have a good influence on each other. Isn't that right?$h",
	"GeorgeDialogues.1": "The librarian who works in the library sometimes comes to my house. Do you know?#$b#She is as friendly as a granddaughter to my wife.",
	"GeorgeDialogues.2": "The day before yesterday, the librarian girl organize my bookshelf. Why would she do that without extra pay?#$e#She is a good person. But as I get older, I doubt good deeds without price.",
	"GeorgeDialogues.3": "I'm glad the librarian girl married a good person like you.^So, you married a librarian girl, right? Actually, I don't understand. Hmm... maybe I'm just old-fashioned.",
	"GeorgeDialogues.4": "So, are you enjoying your happy marriage to Blanche? I hope the two will continue to be happy.$1^I'll admit, I thought it was... strange... for two women to be together. But you're such a nice young woman, and I know you two are in love... I've changed my mind.$1",
	
	//SpouseRoom Dialogues
	
	"RoomDialogues.1":"There is a teddy bear on the soft fabric sofa.",
	"RoomDialogues.2":"This is the rubber plant pot Blanche tends to. This plant looks quite old.",
	"RoomDialogues.3":"There are notes with Blanche's handwriting on them.",
	"RoomDialogues.4":"The bookshelf is full of various poems. Among them is a collection of Rainer Maria Rilke's poems, too.",
	"RoomDialogues.5":"It is a photo album. There is also a picture taken with you inside.",
	"RoomDialogues.6":"Inside the display case are the bouquet, flower crown, and pendant you gave her as gifts.",
	"RoomDialogues.7":"Small succulent plants.",
	"RoomDialogues.8":"Egg cookies and cocoa.",

	
